{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S01、S06等段感受短语较密，话与感受交替阅读比Y左右分栏更费眼，扫读轻松度略逊。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段心理转折，核心要点更容易抓住，而且对人物矛盾的解释更准确，例如想念被当作自己人的日子，同时又害怕为了这份亲近重新忍受委屈。更重要的是，舞步、旧歌、摇篮曲等音乐线索反复出现，并随人物心境变化而变形，加上感受与具体乐句同步出现，形成了比Y更完整的情绪连续性和更细腻的听觉画面。Y胜在扫读轻松，但部分感受表达比较概括，人物心理和音乐之间的对应关系没有X那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2ef23071-a3b9-4881-8e2d-ba88daaa503c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053731353351Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:39:06.795850+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "87b01c5bf3cbe4d9b6e33965d6aeb86c5bbbb97caed5184c8adecf0a4b67edec", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_